# Cloud sync (optional). Without these, the app runs local-only (localStorage).
#
# When you attach "Upstash for Redis" from the Vercel Marketplace (formerly
# Vercel KV), Vercel injects these automatically into the project. To run
# locally against the same store, copy them from the Vercel dashboard
# (Storage → your database → .env.local) or from `vercel env pull`.
#
# Either naming scheme works — Vercel KV names:
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
# ...or plain Upstash names:
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
